<title>UK: Dexia Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Dexia Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEXIA HYPOTHEKENBANK BERLIN AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *3.70     MATURITY    24.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-24.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    BERLIN    DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> NOTES	TO 24.OCT.97 THEN 4.30 PCT THEREAFTER IF NOT CALLED</p>
<p>		AT PAR.</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON.</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 592.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
